      "at": "2026-08-05T21:10:43.640Z",
      "event": "ac-updated",
      "detail": "The literal wording would have kept the status open until the idle window expired, adding a 45-second lag before the closing summary on every ordinary turn — a regression the operator did not ask for. Re-opening on the first post-reply activity gives the same visibility with no lag."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-08-05T21:10:43.725Z",
      "event": "ac-updated",
      "detail": "Narrowed to continuations: an in-turn status is governed by the response guard, and adding a second closing rule for it would race that guard."
    }
